        Divisibility Lemma. The pairs of homogeneous polynomials ρ, τ
which satisfy relation J(ρ, τ ) = ρ played very important role in our consider-
ations. Pairs like this were researched by Dixmier (see [8]) in his seminal paper
devoted to the first Weyl algebra. In this section we will find a restriction on
such pairs.

