```text
wt(A)=-(m-1)=1 mod e,       wt(B)=-(n-1)=1 mod e.
```

But `delta` in (2.2) belongs to the fixed field and also has weight one.
Therefore

```text
e>1  =>  delta=0.                                    (2.4)
