## 1. The panel-constant clash (imported, promoted)

For every cell: both poles are the unique td-7 entry (type (2,3),
`(1,1,2) ⊕ (1,2,3)`, `deg p_{f,P1} = 2`, `deg p_{f,P2} = 4`), so level
